"003:002 The third, Abessalom, the son of Mocha the daughter of Tholmai king of Gedsur; the fourth, Adonia the son of Aggith.",
"003:003 The fifth, Saphatia, the son of Abital; the sixth, Jethraam, born of Agla his wife.",
