"003:016 And the sons of Joakim; Jechonias his son, Sedekias his son.",
"003:017 And the sons of Jechonias; Asir, Salathiel his son,",
"003:018 Melchiram, and Phadaias, and Sanesar, and Jekimia, and Hosamath, and Nabadias.",
