"003:022 And the son of Sechenias; Samaia: and the sons of Samaia; Chattus, and Joel, and Berri and Noadia, and Saphath, six.",
"003:023 And the sons of Noadia: Elithenan, and Ezekia, and Ezricam, three.",
"003:024 And the sons of Elithenan; Odolia, and Heliasebon, and Phadaia, and Akub, and Joanan, and Dalaaia, and Anan, seven."
