"008:001 Now Benjamin begot Bale his firstborn, and Asbel his second son, Aara the third, Noa the fourth,",
"008:002 and Rapha the fifth.",
"008:003 And the sons of Bale were, Adir, and Gera, and Abiud,",
"008:004 and Abessue, and Noama, and Achia,",
"008:005 and Gera, and Sephupham, and Uram.",
"008:006 These were the sons of Aod: these are the heads of families to them that dwell in Gabee, and they removed them to Machanathi:",
"008:007 and Nooma, and Achia and Gera, he removed them, and he begot Aza, and Jachicho.",
"008:008 And Saarin begot children in the plain of Moab, after that he had sent away Osin and Baada his wives.",
"008:009 And he begot of his wife Ada, Jolab, and Sebia, and Misa, and Melchas,",
"008:010 and Jebus, and Zabia, and Marma: these were heads of families.",
"008:011 And of Osin he begot Abitol, and Alphaal.",
"008:012 And the sons of Alphaal; Obed, Misaal, Semmer: he built Ona, and Lod, and its towns:",
"008:013 and Beria, and Sama; these were heads of families amongst the dwellers in Elam, and they drove out the inhabitants of Geth.",
"008:014 And his brethren were Sosec, and Arimoth,",
"008:015 and Zabadia, and Ored, and Eder,",
"008:016 and Michael, and Jespha, and Joda, the sons of Beria:",
"008:017 and Zabadia, and Mosollam, and Azaki, and Abar,",
"008:018 and Isamari, and Jexlias, and Jobab, the sons of Elphaal:",
"008:019 and Jakim, and Zachri, and Zabdi,",
"008:020 and Elionai, and Salathi,",
"008:021 and Elieli, and Adaia, and Baraia, and Samarath, sons of Samaith:",
"008:022 and Jesphan, and Obed, and Eliel,",
"008:023 and Abdon, and Zechri, and Anan,",
"008:024 and Anania, and Ambri, and Aelam, and Anathoth,",
"008:025 and Jathin, and Jephadias, and Phanuel, the sons of Sosec:",
"008:026 and Samsari, and Saarias, and Gotholia,",
"008:027 and Jarasia, and Eria, and Zechri, son of Iroam.",
"008:028 These were heads of families, chiefs according to their generations: these lived in Jerusalem.",
"008:029 And the father of Gabaon lived in Gabaon; and his wife's name was Moacha.",
"008:030 And her firstborn son was Abdon, and Sur, and Kis, and Baal, and Nadab, and Ner,",
"008:031 and Gedur and his brother, and Zacchur, and Makeloth.",
"008:032 And Makeloth begot Samaa: for these lived in Jerusalem in the presence of their brethren with their brethren.",
"008:033 And Ner begot Kis, and Kis begot Saul, and Saul begot Jonathan, and Melchisue, and Aminadab, and Asabal.",
"008:034 And the son of Jonathan was Meribaal; and Meribaal begot Micha.",
"008:035 And the sons of Micha; Phithon, and Melach, and Tharach, and Achaz.",
"008:036 And Achaz begot Jada, and Jada begot Salaemath, and Asmoth, and Zambri; and Zambri begot Maesa;",
"008:037 and Maesa begot Baana: Rhaphaea was his son, Elasa his son, Esel his son.",
"008:038 And Esel had six sons, and these were their name; Ezricam his firstborn, and Ismael, and Saraia, and Abdia, and Anan, and Asa: all these were the sons of Esel.",
"008:039 And the sons of Asel his brother; Aelam his firstborn, and Jas the second, and Eliphalet the third.",
"008:040 And the sons of Aelam were mighty men, bending the bow, and multiplying sons and grandsons, one hundred and fifty. All these were of the sons of Benjamin."
